+    // VAL-002 / VAL-003: low-mana failure must be readable to the player through the mana
+    // indicator (Section 3 Player Experience Success Criteria). PlayerManaUI is the shared
+    // continuous mana indicator, so its reaction to CastDenied is the readability proof.
